#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:11
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Apèsi sou sijè a"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:11
msgid ""
"This page is where you manage all of your <strong>Resource Models</strong> "
"and <strong>Branches</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Paj sa a se kote ou jere tout <strong>Modèl Resous</strong> ou yo ak "
"<strong>Branch</strong> ou yo."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:12
msgid ""
"If you don't see any listed here, you may want to consider <a href=\"https://"
"arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/projects-and-packages\" "
"target=\"_blank\">loading a package</a>. Alternatively, you can directly "
"import individual Resource Model files through <strong>Add ...</strong> "
"(close this panel to find the button). Finally, to start from scratch just "
"<strong>Add ... > New Resource Model</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Si ou pa wè okenn nan lis la, ou ka vle konsidere <a href="
"\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/projects-and-packages\" target="
"\"_blank\">chaje yon pake</a>. Sinon, ou ka enpòte dirèkteman fichye Modèl "
"Resous endividyèl yo ak <strong>Ajoute ...</strong> (fèmen panèl sa a pou "
"jwenn bouton an). Finalman, pou rekòmanse depi nan kòmansman, jis "
"<strong>Ajoute ... > Nouvo Modèl Resous</strong>."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:13
msgid ""
"Once you have some graphs loaded, there are a few management operations "
"which are only accessible through this page. Use <strong>Manage ...</strong> "
"on a graph to perform the following actions:"
msgstr ""
"Yon fwa ou fin chaje kèk graf, gen kèk operasyon jesyon ki aksesib sèlman "
"sou paj sa a. Sèvi ak <strong>Jere ...</strong> sou yon graf pou fè aksyon "
"sa yo:"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:16
#: app/templates/views/graph.htm:128
msgid "Manage Graph"
msgstr "Jere Graf la"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:17
msgid "Enter the Graph Designer. This is where the magic happens!"
msgstr "Antre nan Graph Designer la. Se la maji a fèt!"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:20
#: app/templates/views/graph.htm:153
msgid "Manage Functions"
msgstr "Jere Fonksyon yo"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:21
#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:25
#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:29
#| msgid "Resource Models"
msgid "Resource Models only"
msgstr "Modèl Resous sèlman"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:21
msgid ""
"Enter the Function Manager. <strong>You must use the Function Manager to "
"configure the display names of your resources!</strong> Otherwise, all your "
"resources will just be labeled \"Untitled\" in the search results and on the "
"map."
msgstr ""
"Antre nan Jesyonè Fonksyon an. <strong>Ou dwe itilize Jesyonè Fonksyon an "
"pou konfigire non resous ou yo!</strong> Sinon, tout resous ou yo ap gen "
"etikèt \"San Tit\" nan rezilta rechèch yo ak sou kat la."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:24
#: app/templates/views/graph.htm:157
msgid "Create Mapping File"
msgstr "Kreye yon dosye maping"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:25
msgid ""
"You will need a Mapping File if you plan to <a href=\"https://"
"arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/import-export\" target=\"_blank\">bulk "
"import resources</a> from a CSV file."
msgstr ""
"W ap bezwen yon Fichye Map si w gen plan pou <a href="
"\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/import-export\" target=\"_blank\""
">enpòte resous an gwo</a> soti nan yon fichye CSV."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:28
#: app/templates/views/graph.htm:160
msgid "Delete Instances"
msgstr "Efase Enstans yo"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:29
msgid ""
"Delete all resource instances that have been made with this Resource Model. "
"<strong>This operation is not reversible!</strong> It's likely this "
"operation would never be used outside of initial installation and testing."
msgstr ""
"Efase tout egzanp resous ki te kreye ak Modèl Resous sa a. <strong>Operasyon "
"sa a pa ka ranvèse!</strong> Li pwobab ke operasyon sa a pa janm pral "
"itilize deyò enstalasyon ak tès inisyal la."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:32
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:856
#: app/templates/views/rdm/modals/export-scheme-form.htm:27
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Ekspòtasyon"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:33
msgid ""
"Export this graph to a .json file. It can then be imported into a different "
"Arches installation, or copied into a package."
msgstr ""
"Ekspòte graf sa a nan yon fichye .json. Apre sa, ou ka enpòte l nan yon lòt "
"enstalasyon Arches, oubyen kopye l nan yon pake."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:36
#| msgid "Clone Model"
msgid "Clone"
msgstr "Klone"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:37
msgid ""
"Create a duplicate of this graph. Useful during development if you want to "
"alter a Resource Model that already has resource instances saved."
msgstr ""
"Kreye yon kopi graf sa a. Itil pandan devlopman si ou vle modifye yon Modèl "
"Resous ki deja gen egzanp resous ki anrejistre."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:40
#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:19
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:761 app/templates/javascript.htm:940
#: app/templates/views/components/plugins/workflow.htm:34
#: app/templates/views/graph/function-manager.htm:134
#: app/templates/views/rdm/modals/delete-collection-form.htm:44
#: app/templates/views/rdm/modals/delete-scheme-form.htm:44
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Efase"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:41
msgid ""
"Delete this graph. If this is a Resource Model, all resource instances that "
"have been made with it will also be deleted (as with <strong>Delete "
"Instances</strong> operation above)."
msgstr ""
"Efase graf sa a. Si se yon Modèl Resous, tout enstans resous ki te kreye "
"avèk li yo pral efase tou (menm jan ak operasyon <strong>Efase Enstans</"
"strong> pi wo a)."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:48
#| msgid "Create Arches Resource Models and Branches"
msgid "What are Resource Models and Branches?"
msgstr "Kisa Modèl Resous ak Branch ye?"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:52
msgid ""
"At the core of an Arches database are a series of structures called "
"\"graphs\", of which there are two types:"
msgstr ""
"Nannan yon bazdone Arches se yon seri estrikti nou rele \"graf\", gen de "
"kategori graf ki egziste:"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:53
msgid ""
"<strong>Resource Models</strong> -  When creating new Resources, a data "
"entry user must decide which Resource Model to use, determining what "
"information is collected for the Resource. Think of different Resource "
"Models as categories of records in your database&mdash;\"Buildings\" vs. "
"\"Archaeological Sites\" vs. \"Cemeteries\", for example. Every Arches "
"database must have at least one Resource Model."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Modèl Resous</strong> - Lè yon itilizatè ki ap antre done kreye "
"nouvo Resous, li dwe deside ki Modèl Resous ki ka itilize, pou detèmine ki "
"enfòmasyon ki pral kolekte pou Resous la. Konsidere diferan Modèl Resous yo "
"kòm kategori anrejistreman nan bazdone ou la&mdash;pa egzanp, \"Bilding\" "
"vs. \"Sit Akeyolojik\" vs. \"Simityè\". Chak bazdone Arches dwe gen omwen "
"yon Modèl Resous."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:54
msgid ""
"<strong>Branches</strong> - You can think of Branches as \"partial\" graphs "
"that can be aggregated to form the \"full\" graph of a Resource Model. They "
"function as resuable building blocks, allowing you to avoid having to "
"manually recreate complex structures in multiple Resource Models."
msgstr ""

